{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05874","headline":"晦日游大理韦卿城南别业四声依次用各六韵 三 · 王维","name":"晦日游大理韦卿城南别业四声依次用各六韵 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬中余雪在，墟上春流驶。\n风日畅怀抱，山川多秀气。\n雕胡先晨炊，庖脍亦云至。\n高情浪海岳，浮生寄天地。\n君子外簪缨，埃尘良不啻。\n所乐衡门中，陶然忘其贵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05874.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05874","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}